{
  "title": "Nginx GWC Cache Hit Ratio",
  "uid": "nginx-cache-hit-ratio",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "tags": ["cache", "nginx", "gwc"],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Cache Hit Ratio — real users",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.7 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.85 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"nginx\", cache_status=\"HIT\"} != \"172.18.0.1\" [$__range])) / sum(count_over_time({job=\"nginx\", cache_status=~\"HIT|MISS|BYPASS|EXPIRED|STALE|UPDATING|REVALIDATED\"} != \"172.18.0.1\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The number that matters: cache hit ratio for REAL browser traffic only. The seed_tiles.py warm-up robot (Docker gateway 172.18.0.1) is excluded via the `!= \"172.18.0.1\"` line filter — its whole job is to fire first-touch requests that populate the cache (MISS by definition), so including it made the ratio meaningless (~45% was ~98% warm-up traffic). If the docker_default bridge is ever recreated with a different subnet, update the 172.18.0.1 filter in all panels."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Real-user cacheable requests (range)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"nginx\", cache_status=~\"HIT|MISS|BYPASS|EXPIRED|STALE|UPDATING|REVALIDATED\"} != \"172.18.0.1\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "description": "GWC tile requests from real browsers (warm-up excluded) that hit the cache zone in the selected range."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Warm-up hit ratio (robot, info only)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "text", "value": null }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"nginx\", cache_status=\"HIT\"} |= \"172.18.0.1\" [$__range])) / sum(count_over_time({job=\"nginx\", cache_status=~\"HIT|MISS|BYPASS|EXPIRED|STALE|UPDATING|REVALIDATED\"} |= \"172.18.0.1\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Diagnostic only — NOT user experience. Hit ratio of the seed_tiles.py warm-up robot (172.18.0.1). Low here is normal (first-touch tiles are MISS by design). It rising over time means consecutive warm-up runs increasingly overlap already-cached tiles = warm-up is doing redundant work (see the plan to warm only new forecast dates)."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Request rate by cache status — real users",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 30, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" }, "drawStyle": "bars" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["sum"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum by (cache_status) (count_over_time({job=\"nginx\", cache_status=~\"HIT|MISS|BYPASS|EXPIRED|STALE|UPDATING|REVALIDATED\"} != \"172.18.0.1\" [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{cache_status}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Real browser traffic only (warm-up robot excluded). The giant warm-up spikes that used to dominate this graph are gone — what remains is genuine user-driven HIT vs MISS."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Raw counts by cache status — real users (range)",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 18 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum by (cache_status) (count_over_time({job=\"nginx\"} != \"172.18.0.1\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Real-user breakdown. cache_status=\"-\" means the request hit a location with no proxy_cache at all (plain /geoserver/wms, static assets) — not a miss, just not cacheable."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Raw counts by cache status — warm-up robot (range)",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 18 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum by (cache_status) (count_over_time({job=\"nginx\"} |= \"172.18.0.1\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The seed_tiles.py warm-up robot's own traffic, kept here for reference so it isn't lost — just separated from the user-facing metric."
    }
  ]
}
